ption is not supported by the provided frames**, which do not show Wieber or any other gymnast performing.\n\n---\n\n**5) Note any differences or similarities in their attire:**\n\nThere are **no differences to note**, because only one gymnast’s attire is visible in the frames. The frames do not contain a “third contestant” to compare with the “second.”\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**\n\nAnswer '1' — “There are no differences because they are from the same national team” — **cannot be verified as correct** based solely on the provided frames. While it is historically true that the USA gymnasts wore identical leotards in 2012, **the frames do not show a third contestant**, making the comparison impossible within the given visual data.\n\nTherefore, **answer '1' is incorrect for this specific set of frames**, because the premise of the question (comparing second and third contestants) cannot be fulfilled — only one contestant is visible.\n\n✅ **Final Verdict: Answer '1' is NOT correct based on the provided frames.**"}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 90, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0517.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0518.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0529.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0530.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0531.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0532.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0533.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0534.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0535.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0536.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0537.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0538.jpg', '/mnt/ss