he same team uniform.\n\n---\n\n✅ **Conclusion:**\n\nAnswer '1' — “There are no differences because they are from the same national team” — is **correct**.\n\nWhile there may be microscopic or custom-fit variations between individual leotards (as is common in elite gymnastics), **visually, there are no meaningful differences** in color, pattern, or design. Both athletes are wearing the official USA team leotard for the 2012 Olympics, and the frames confirm they are from the same national team.\n\n**Final Answer: 1 (Correct)**"}, {'batch_start': 90, 'batch_end': 117, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0708.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0709.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0710.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0716.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0717.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0718.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0719.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0720.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0721.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0722.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0723.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0724.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0725.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0726.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0733.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0734.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0735.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjoDzK0siaM/frames/frame_0736.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/hjo